1. Insert USB Stick, formatted to FAT32
2. Sticks larger than 32GB must be partitioned to no larger than 32GB
3. Create the Zebra folder into the root file of the USB stick
4. Create three folders under Zebra: appl, commands, and files
5. Put the ZPL code in the commands folder
6. Put any files you want to add, such as certificates in the files folder
7. Power on Zebra Printer, insert stick after fully booted, it will reboot, pull out during reboot
